WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.401 --> 00:00:04.157
This is Duo, logged in as a real user. In My profile,

2
00:00:04.157 --> 00:00:08.906
the Calendar card lets each user connect their own Google Calendar.

3
00:00:09.355 --> 00:00:12.124
The user clicks Connect Google Calendar,

4
00:00:12.124 --> 00:00:15.308
and Duo starts the standard Google OAuth flow.

5
00:00:15.758 --> 00:00:19.231
This is the real Google page, shown in English.

6
00:00:19.231 --> 00:00:24.181
The address carries Duo's client ID and the exact scopes requested:

7
00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:28.393
openid, email, and calendar dot events. After signing in,

8
00:00:28.393 --> 00:00:33.122
the user sees the consent screen and grants calendar dot events.

9
00:00:34.621 --> 00:00:38.617
Back in Duo, the card now shows the connected Google account.

10
00:00:38.617 --> 00:00:41.368
From here on, everything happens for real,

11
00:00:41.368 --> 00:00:43.595
in this account's Google Calendar.

12
00:00:44.045 --> 00:00:45.316
Now, in the CRM,

13
00:00:45.316 --> 00:00:49.843
the user opens a lead and creates a task of type Meeting,

14
00:00:49.843 --> 00:00:53.338
with a title, a date, a time and a duration.

15
00:01:00.781 --> 00:01:05.712
The form confirms that the meeting goes to the connected Google Calendar.

16
00:01:05.712 --> 00:01:07.265
The user clicks Create.

17
00:01:07.716 --> 00:01:09.531
Using calendar dot events,

18
00:01:09.531 --> 00:01:13.161
Duo created the event in the user's Google Calendar,

19
00:01:13.161 --> 00:01:14.837
with a Google Meet link.

20
00:01:14.837 --> 00:01:19.374
The panel shows the event read live from the Google Calendar API.

21
00:01:19.374 --> 00:01:22.725
The task in Duo now shows the Join meeting link.

22
00:01:24.226 --> 00:01:28.892
If the meeting is rescheduled in Duo, here from ten to eleven o'clock,

23
00:01:28.892 --> 00:01:31.959
Duo updates the same event in Google Calendar.

24
00:01:39.253 --> 00:01:42.791
And if the meeting is canceled, by deleting the task,

25
00:01:42.791 --> 00:01:45.662
Duo deletes the event from Google Calendar.

26
00:01:50.459 --> 00:01:51.744
Duo only creates,

27
00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:56.580
updates and deletes the events of meetings scheduled in its CRM.

28
00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.696
It never reads other events.
